1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,726
Huygens simply declared that the wavelets have no strength backwards.

2
00:00:04,726 --> 00:00:07,734
Later, Fresnel and Kirchhoff showed why.

3
00:00:07,734 --> 00:00:17,604
The amplitude of a wavelet depends on the angle theta from the forward direction, through the obliquity factor, K equals a half, one plus cos theta.

